2. English word frequencies: Google Books Ngram Viewer export, version 3
   (20200217), English 1-grams (https://books.google.com/ngrams), as
   case-folded and aggregated by the gwordlist project
   (https://github.com/hackerb9/gwordlist, file frequency-all.txt.gz).

   Google releases the Ngram data under Creative Commons Attribution 3.0
   (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/).  The gwordlist README
   (https://github.com/hackerb9/gwordlist/blob/master/README.md, section
   "What can this data be used for?") states, as its sole licence statement
   for the data:

     "Anything you want. While my programs are licensed under the GNU GPL
      >=3, I'm explicitly releasing the data produced under the same
      license as Google granted me: Creative Commons Attribution 3.0."

   kswime uses only that data (no gwordlist program code).  The English
   lexicon inside data/model.bin (en section) is derived from it.
   Attribution: Google Books Ngram Viewer / Google Inc.; aggregation by
   hackerb9 (gwordlist).

