3. English word validation: SCOWL / English Speller Database (ESDB)
   (https://github.com/en-wl/wordlist, file data/scowl-pre.txt; words with
   size <= 70 are used, so neither the Australian nor the UKACD section of
   its Copyright file applies).  data/raw/en_scowl70.txt is extracted from
   it and used at build time to validate short English tokens.

